                                <path d="M 28 78 C 55 78, 85 44, 110 44 C 135 44, 165 78, 185 78" fill="none" stroke="#0284c7" stroke-width="2"/>
                                <text x="135" y="40" font-size="7.2" font-weight="900" fill="#0284c7" text-anchor="middle">B: 푹신한 방석</text>
                                <line x1="22" y1="44" x2="110" y2="44" stroke="#0284c7" stroke-dasharray="1.5,1.5" stroke-width="1"/>
                                <text x="18" y="47" font-size="7" font-weight="bold" fill="#0284c7" text-anchor="end">F₂</text>

                                <!-- Time labels -->
                                <line x1="76" y1="78" x2="76" y2="82" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                                <text x="76" y="89" font-size="7" font-weight="bold" fill="#ef4444" text-anchor="middle">Δt₁</text>

                                <line x1="185" y1="78" x2="185" y2="82" stroke="#0284c7" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                                <text x="185" y="89" font-size="7" font-weight="bold" fill="#0284c7" text-anchor="middle">Δt₂</text>

                                <!-- Badge: Area equal -->
                                <rect x="80" y="56" width="92" height="16" rx="3" fill="#0f172a" opacity="0.9"/>
                                <text x="126" y="68" font-size="7.2" font-weight="900" fill="#38bdf8" text-anchor="middle">면적 S<tspan font-size="5.5" dy="1.8">A</tspan><tspan font-size="7.2" dy="-1.8"> = S</tspan><tspan font-size="5.5" dy="1.8">B</tspan><tspan font-size="7.2" dy="-1.8"> = I = Δp</tspan></text>
                            </svg>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <div class="sub-box">
                        <ul class="bullet-list">
                            <li><b>동일 조건:</b> 질량(m)과 낙하 높이(h)가 같으므로 충돌 직전 속도와 <b>충격량(I = Δp = mv)은 두 경우 완전히 동일함</b>.</li>
                            <li><b>차이점:</b> 방석(B)은 충돌 시간(Δt)을 길게 늘려 물체가 받는 <b>평균 충격력(F̄ = I/Δt)을 줄여 파손을 방지함</b>.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- [자료 2] 자동차 안전장치 복합 메커니즘 일러스트 -->
                <div class="info-box">
                    <div class="info-box-title">
                        <span>■ [자료 2] 자동차 충돌 안전 시스템 (크럼플 존 & 에어백 & 안전벨트)</span>
                        <span style="font-size:8px; color:#0369a1; font-weight:bold;">다중 충격 완화 메커니즘</span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Textbook Quality SVG 2 : Car Safety System Diagram -->
                    <div style="background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius:6px; padding:4px 3px; text-align:center;">
                        <svg width="436" height="82" viewBox="0 0 436 82">
                            <!-- Background Track & Impact Wall -->
                            <line x1="8" y1="68" x2="428" y2="68" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                            
                            <!-- Concrete Wall with stripes -->
                            <rect x="396" y="14" width="22" height="54" fill="#475569" stroke="#1e293b" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                            <line x1="396" y1="24" x2="418" y2="34" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1.2"/>
